projects.description:
The REFRAME project aims to reduce abusive practices and violations of human and labour rights during the recruitment process and maximize the protection of migrant workers in the recruitment process and their contribution to development. Recognizing the various challenges encountered by migrant workers during the recruitment process, the REFRAME project aims at making interventions in the following spheres in Pakistan: 
•	Improve the institutional capacities of stakeholders to implement initiatives on fair recruitment;
•	Increase accessibility to accurate information, knowledge, tools on fair recruitment to migrant workers and other relevant stakeholders;
•	Develop and implement integrated strategies to address unfair recruitment through relevant stakeholders.
